# 📞 Contact Management System

A Python-based Contact Management System that allows users to store, manage, search, update, and delete contacts efficiently using dictionaries and JSON file handling.

---

# 🚀 Features

## ✅ Core Features
- Add new contacts
- Search contacts using partial name matching
- Update existing contacts
- Delete contacts with confirmation
- Display all saved contacts

## ✅ Advanced Features
- Search contacts by phone number
- Contact groups/categories
- Export contacts to CSV
- Contact statistics
- JSON file storage
- Backup functionality

## ✅ Validation & Error Handling
- Phone number validation
- Email validation
- Duplicate contact prevention
- Menu input validation

---

